2026-07-21T08:33:03.8303333Z     
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8303586Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8304061Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8304445Z     
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8304635Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8304873Z     
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8305062Z     .. code-block:: python
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8305284Z     
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8305472Z         # content of test_sample.py
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8305729Z         def inc(x):
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8305934Z             return x + 1
2026-07-21T08:33:03.8306142Z     
